sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant LK as LiveKit AvatarRunner
    participant Gen as AlwaysBusyGenerator
    participant TP as TalkingProducer
    participant Q as StreamQueue
    participant Drv as Driver
    participant Sess as InferenceSession
    participant W as Triton worker

    Note over Drv,W: steady state — idle stream driving,<br/>broadcast_queue holds ~0.2s of frames

    LK->>Gen: push_audio(frame 0)
    Gen->>Gen: acquire_sequence → SequenceManager(id)
    Gen->>TP: create + run task<br/>(sentiment resolved lazily from 1st audio frame)
    Gen->>Q: driver.commit(talking stream)
    Note over Q,Drv: ready-gating — idle keeps driving.<br/>No preemption until the stream has content

    TP->>TP: AudioPreprocessor.push per frame —<br/>emits a chunk once 100 frames (4s) accumulate
    TP->>TP: stream.put(chunk 0) → ready.set()

    Q-->>Drv: get() unblocks — head is ready
    Drv->>Drv: idle.cancel() · await idle drive<br/>(idle StreamEnd ships after 0.2s re-buffer gate)
    Note over Gen: idle StreamEnd filtered in __aiter__<br/>(label != TALKING)

    Drv->>Sess: infer_chunk(chunk 0,<br/>cancel_previous=True, pass_prev_context=True)
    Sess->>W: request: audio + prev_motion/audio_feat = orchestrator<br/>context ring (last ~10 paced frames)<br/>+ request_id_to_cancel = idle's in-flight request
    W->>W: cancel idle slot work,<br/>continue from prev_motion_feat in the request

    loop partial responses
        W-->>Sess: InferResponse(video_frames, motion_ctx, audio_ctx)
        Sess-->>Drv: on_frame(video, commit_to_context) per frame
        Drv->>Drv: pair with broadcast audio → buffers
        Drv-->>Gen: PairedFrame(label=TALKING)
        Gen->>Gen: observer.on_frame → start_sequence (first frame only)
        Gen-->>LK: yield (video, audio)
    end

    Note over Drv,Sess: later chunks: cancel_previous=False,<br/>pass_prev_context=False (server-side sequence cache)
